{"id":"0849bf4363d60a31","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-thm-replacement.md","title":"Replacement","display":"thm-replacement — Replacement","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-replacement","aliases":["58-thm-replacement"],"display":"thm-replacement — Replacement","depends_on":["[[58-ax-rep]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-replacement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-replacement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-replacement — Replacement"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b72c632f5deae9c3\" href=\"?note=b72c632f5deae9c3\" title=\"58-ax-rep\">58-ax-rep</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p)\">\\(\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p)\\)</span> (formula defining a functional class relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Set}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Set}_S\\)</span> (set predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}replacement} \\vdash \\mathrm{Set}_S(A)\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\exists!y\\in V\\;\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p)\\to\\exists B\\in V\\;\\forall y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(y\\in B\\leftrightarrow\\exists x\\in A\\;\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}replacement} \\vdash \\mathrm{Set}_S(A)\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\exists!y\\in V\\;\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p)\\to\\exists B\\in V\\;\\forall y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(y\\in B\\leftrightarrow\\exists x\\in A\\;\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is one instance of the replacement schema: the defining formula <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> and parameters <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec p\">\\(\\vec p\\)</span> are arbitrary.</li>\n<li>Restricting the statement to a set-coded function would miss the point, because its range is already a set by elementary set operations.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-rep","status":"resolved","id":"b72c632f5deae9c3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-rep]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Set}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}replacement} \\vdash \\mathrm{Set}_S(A)\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\exists!y\\in V\\;\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p)\\to\\exists B\\in V\\;\\forall y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(y\\in B\\leftrightarrow\\exists x\\in A\\;\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec p","display":false}],"bytes":934,"backlinks":[{"id":"f1b20720c6db9b0a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4394","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-thm-replacement.md|58-thm-replacement]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["b72c632f5deae9c3","65418b505fc53093","65d9a1e690c32aad"]}